          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Broad straps reduce the pressure exerted by the bag onNarrow our shoulders as compared to narrow straps. Therefore, we feel more comfortable carrying a bag with broad straps."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
